      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Same thing here. My performance and FPS drop horribly when in my main 3.0 avatar. It happened both before the new SDK update and after. Uploading with the new SDK did not fix it at all. I made a lot of optimizations to it yet it still happens. Before these recent updates, that avatar worked perfectly/ It only started causing huge frame drops after these recent updates. Other avatars seem fine. This one in particular seems bugged.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "5f9bd1ac7355147e1eca77be",
