      "value": "Also - side thought - if this is animator looping activate - deactivate state it might be similar to what people describe here - but instead of sound source it affects mesh (another similarity - randomness):\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1004-some-animations-are-playing-repeatedly\nPeople may not realise yet some of their ava 3.0 features have a chance to kill other peoples fps.",
