  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Ever since the new update Ive been trying to fix my avatar so it would work like it should. But now ingame everytime I use 3.0 avatars my fps drops significantly and I have no idea why.\nEdit: It seems like I have a bad version of this. My avatar reduces everyones frames down to 11 while I don't feel it. But if I reset my avatar I get the same amount of frames and everyone else either gets their fps back or stays the same. It also seems like 3.0 avatars overall reduce peoples fps by 20-30 frames. I checked this by using my other 3.0 avatars which have less things on them and my friends using theirs.",
